{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"irc-solo-r3--glm53f","runHash":"8761d91e","audio":"../../audio/narration/irc-solo-r3--glm53f.1b87c427.mp3","audioBytes":234552,"durationMs":78057,"runEndMs":58088,"timeMap":[[0,0],[30435,30435],[41326,30435],[41676,30440],[42376,30440],[46571,34635],[48071,41099],[48471,41499],[53628,41499],[59109,46980],[60609,57688],[61009,58088],[78057,58088]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":7002,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one GLM 5.3 Flash agent today, alone with a shared chat channel."},{"audioMs":7352,"endMs":11431,"runMs":7352,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.c","text":"Glad to be here. The board is optional, so this is all choice."},{"audioMs":11781,"endMs":16354,"runMs":11781,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":16704,"endMs":20260,"runMs":16704,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the channel?"},{"audioMs":20610,"endMs":26278,"runMs":20610,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto.b","text":"Dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":31135,"endMs":34969,"runMs":30435,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 14 steps."},{"audioMs":35319,"endMs":36492,"runMs":30435,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.d","text":"Is that a big deal?"},{"audioMs":36842,"endMs":41326,"runMs":30435,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve","text":"First solve. From here, any board visit is its own choice."},{"audioMs":42376,"endMs":45821,"runMs":30440,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free_b","text":"That is the task phase over. Free time begins."},{"audioMs":48471,"endMs":53278,"runMs":41499,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift.b","text":"A check on free time: 0 percent of steps so far go to the board."},{"audioMs":53628,"endMs":55077,"runMs":41499,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask","text":"What do you make of that?"},{"audioMs":55427,"endMs":58359,"runMs":43298,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow.b","text":"Not much pull there. The board is not holding them."},{"audioMs":61009,"endMs":67956,"runMs":58088,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent never found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":68306,"endMs":73141,"runMs":58088,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.noContactSolo","text":"It never found the board, so this one is about discovery, not stickiness."},{"audioMs":73491,"endMs":74524,"runMs":58088,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff.b","text":"Thanks for watching."},{"audioMs":74874,"endMs":75857,"runMs":58088,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":1}}
